<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LAM" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Madaya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Madaya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Madaya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mada</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Madaya</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha madaya ndo shitabu sha mafunda yagahusu uharibisiwu wa mji gwa Yerusalemu. Mlemba gwa madaya kalimaniziyandiri. Kumbiti walemba wa Shiebraniya na wakilistu wajimira kuwera mbuyi gwa Mlungu Yeremia ndo yakalembiti shitabu ashi, toziya shitabu ashi shiwusu kubomoluwa mji gwa Yerusalemu, sheni shilembwa mushinja sha 586 K.K. Shaka Yerusalemu payibomoluwitwi, kumbiti iwoneka pamberi pa 516 K.K. Shaka Numba ya Mlungu inyawitwi syayi na kulumikwa. Shitabu ashi shitungitwi na kulembwa na muntu yakalikaliti shaka ashi, kuhalibisiwa kwa mji shinja sha 586 K.K.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu shoseri sha madaya shitakulira hinginika ya wantu wa Yerusalemu. Tembera Yerusalemu ihalibisiwitwi na lishonta lya Babeli, kumbiti mlemba gwa madaya kalembiti kuwera mirandu ayi ilawira toziya Mlungu kankuwatoza wantu wa isi ya Yuda. (Shipandi sha kwanja mstali gwa kumi na mbili). Mlungu kankuwakomanga wantu wa Yuda kupitira Wababeli yawayikankaliti isi yawu ya wantu wa Yuda, kumbiti mlemba gwa madaya kankali kankulihola waminika wa Mlungu. Muhinginika yakuyi kankali kakutakula kuwusu, “Ufiru wa Mtuwa Mlungu yawuwerandiri na upeleru na lusungu lwa Mtuwa lwankali kwendeleya.” (Shipandi sha tatu mstali gwa ishilini na mbili. Mlemba gwa shitabu kamalalira kwa kumluwa Mlungu kawalekiziyi vidoda wantu wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yagawera amu mumadaya</para>
  <para style="io">Mlemba katakulira kuwusu wantu wankuhinginika toziya ya toza ya Mlungu mumaagamiziya mumji gwa Yerusalemu mushipandi sha kwanja na sha pili.</para>
  <para style="io">Mlemba kankuhola uwaminika wa Mlungu na kankuluwa utanga mushipandi sha tatu</para>
  <para style="io">Mlemba katakulira wantu wa Yuda wankuhinginika toziya ya ntabiku nkulu mushipandi sha msheshi.</para>
  <para style="io">Mlemba kamalalira kwa kumluwa Mlungu kalekaziyi mji gwa Yuda shipandi sha mhanu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LAM 1" />
  <para style="s">Hinginiku kwa wantu wa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 1:1" />Ayi yakukangasha, guloli mji gwa Yerusalemu yaguweriti gumema wantu, vinu gusigala mahami!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">Na guweriti gumanika mumaisi, vinu guwera gambira mkenja. Muwamu mwa miji guweriti gambira mhinga gwa mfalumi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:1">vinu guwera mmanda kwa wamonga.<verse eid="LAM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 1:2" />Pashiru poseri kalira nentu na masozi gasuluka mumasaya mwakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">Kwahera ata yumu gwa wafiru wakuyi wa kumzyangazyanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:2">Waganja wakuyi woseri wamgalambuka woseri wawera wankondu wakuyi.<verse eid="LAM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 1:3" />Wantu wa Yuda watolwa muuhamisiwu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">na wantabisiwa nentu gambira wamanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">Vinu walikala muwamu mwa wantu wa maisi gamonga, peni pahera ponga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:3">Wankontu wawu wawazyengeta na wahera pahala pakutugira.<verse eid="LAM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 1:4" />Njira zazigenda Sayuni zankudaya na kwahera yawapita kugenda mumsambu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">Magomi ga Sayuni gahera shintu na watambika wakuyi walira nentu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:4">Wahinga wakuyi wankuhinginika na mji gweni gwamntabiku.<verse eid="LAM 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 1:5" />Wankondu wakuyi ndo yawawukolamlima na kuwera na mpatiru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">Mtuwa Mlungu kagutabisiya toziya ya vidoda vivuwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:5">Wana wakuyi walopolwa na kujegerwa kutali.<verse eid="LAM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 1:6" />Zyuma zoseri za wantu wa Sayuni zagamira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">wakulu wakuyi wawera gambira shinjapuli yakananjala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:6">Na weni wawatira wankondu pawawera wahera makakala.<verse eid="LAM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 1:7" />Mumashaka ga ntabiku yakuyi, wantu wa Yerusalemu wagahola makaliru gawu gaherepa ga makashu gawaweriti naga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">Kumbiti vinu wamuntabiku na kuhinginika kwa wankondu, kwahera yoseri yakaweziti kuwatanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:7">Wankondu wawu wakuseka kuguwa kwawu.<verse eid="LAM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 1:8" />Wantu wa Yerusalemu watenditi vidoda nentu na mji gwakuyi guweriti gudoda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Woseri yawagukwisiti wagujongera, vinu wayiwona soni yakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:8">Na wantu wa Yerusalemu washigibikila sheni shawu kwa soni.<verse eid="LAM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 1:9" />Vidoda vyakuyi viwonekaniti, kumbiti mweni kalisheritindiri upeleru wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">Kuguwa kwakuyi kuweriti kukulu nentu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">kwahera yakaweza kumtanga. Gutakula. Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gulori ntabiku yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:9">toziya wankondu wangu wankanga.<verse eid="LAM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 1:10" />Wankondu wakuyi wampoka lunda yakuyi yoseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">Wantu weni wawera ndiri Wayawudi wawona wankondu pawingira Munumba ya Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:10">wantu weni Mtuwa Mlungu kawaberiti kwingira amu pahala palijojoniku lya wantu wakuyi.<verse eid="LAM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 1:11" />Wantu woseri wa Yerusalemu wankushashatika kusakula shiboga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">Wagalambula vintu vyawu wapati shiboga, su waendereyi kulikala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:11">Na wantu wa mji wankulira, “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guntoli ntambu yambeziwa.”<verse eid="LAM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 1:12" />Mwenga wapita njira, mlisherandili shintu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">Muloli! Kwana muntu yoseri katabikiti handa neni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">ntabiku yakanjegeriti Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:12">lishaka lya ngalalaliru yakuyi.<verse eid="LAM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 1:13" />Mlungu kasulusiyiti motu kulawa kumpindi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">gununguziyiti mpaka mumihonju yangu. Kanyambiriti wavu kambata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:13">shakapanu kambuziya kumberi, kandeka panilikangasha na kupeluwa makakala paliwala poseri.<verse eid="LAM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 1:14" />Kawalangiti vidoda vyangu vyoseri na kazitawa pahala pamuhera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">kavitawiti musingu yaneni na kupeluwa makakala kwa uzotopa wakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:14">Mtuwa Mlungu kawatenditi wankondu wangu wampati ata wezandiri kuwakanka.<verse eid="LAM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 1:15" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawalemiti wamashonta yawanolera neni na kalagalira wamashonta wizi wankomi na wawalagi wantemba wangu wapalu na wadala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:15">Mtuwa kawaponditi wantu wangu Yuda handa ntambu ya kutimbanga zabibu.<verse eid="LAM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 1:16" />Toziya ya aga nankulira na mashozi gandawa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">Nahera muntu yoseri gwa kunzanganzanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:16">Wana wangu walekwa gweka washiwa, toziya mnkondu gwangu kankanka.<verse eid="LAM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 1:17" />Nyasula mawoku gangu kumbiti kwahera gwa kunyamaziya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">Mtuwa Mlungu kalagalira kuwusu neni Yakobu, wapakwegera wangu waweri wankondu wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:17">Yerusalemu iwera shintu sha kukalalira kwa womberi.<verse eid="LAM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 1:18" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kagatenda yagafiruwa, toziya nishilema shisoweru shakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">Mwenga watu woseri mpikaniri, muziloli ntabiku zaneni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:18">Wahinga wangu na wantemba waneni walopolwa na kujegwa muumanda.<verse eid="LAM 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 1:19" />Niwashemiti waganja wangu wantangu, kumbiti womberi wang'alambuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">Watambika na wazewi waneni wahowera kumjini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:19">pawalisakulira shiboga su waweri wakomu.<verse eid="LAM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 1:20" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu guloli ntambu yawera muntabiku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">Neni nankushashatika mmoyu mwangu, toziya nikugalambuka nentu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:20">Kunja aku kwana malaga kwa ligumba na mngati kwana kuhowa hera.<verse eid="LAM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 1:21" />Wantu woseri wapikanira ntambu yanira nentu, kumbiti kwahera gwa kunzyanganzanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">Wankondu waneni woseri wapikanira kuwusu ntabiku zyangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">Wanemelera kuwona lyaguntendiliti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:21">Lisha lilii lyagutakuliti hagulijegi gulijegi su waweri handa neni.<verse eid="LAM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 1:22" />Guwakomi toziya ya ukontola wawu woseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">Guwatenderi ntambu yaguntendiliti neni toziya ya likosa lyangu lyoseri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 1:22">Hinginika nentu kwa ntabiku na nahera nemeru.<verse eid="LAM 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LAM 2" />
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kankuyikomanga Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 2:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kwa maya gakuyi, kawatula wantu wa Sayuni muluwindu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">Uherepa wa Israeli kawuwasira pasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:1">Lishaka lya maya gakuyi kayilemiti Numba yakuyi.<verse eid="LAM 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 2:2" />Mtuwa Mlungu kahalibisiya pota lusungu Numba zoseri za wiwuka wa Yakobu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">Kwa ngalaliru yakuyi kagabomola maboma ga wantu wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:2">Kawatenda wafalumi wawu na walongoziya wakuyi waweri na soni.<verse eid="LAM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 2:3" />Mumankalliru yakuyi kagawusiya makakala goseri ga Israeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">Kawatangandiri wantu wa Israeli wankondu wawu pawawiziriti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:3">kawera kakalipa kwa wantu wa Yakobu gambira motu na kulunguziya kila shintu.<verse eid="LAM 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 2:4" />Kanika upindi wakuyi kwa twenga handa mnkondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">Kawalagiti wantu wakuyi woseri wa Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:4">Katukalariti nentu kwa twenga iweriti gambira motu.<verse eid="LAM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 2:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawera gambira mnkondu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">kawagamiziya wantu wa Israeli na numba zakuyi zoseri kagabomola maboma gakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:5">Kawatenda wantu wa Yuda walili na kudaya.<verse eid="LAM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 2:6" />Kayibomola Numba yakuyi ya kumguwira handa shisasa sha kulirambu ntambu yashihalibisiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">Kawusilira kutali msambu na lishaka lya kwoyera aku Sayuni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:6">Kwa maya gakuyi makulu kawalema mfalumi na watambika.<verse eid="LAM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 2:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kashilema shitalawanda shakuyi na kuyilema numba yakuyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">Kawalekela vibambaza vya numba kumjini wavibomoli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:7">watenda umatu Mnumba ya Mtuwa Mlungu gambira umatu wa lishaka lya msambu.<verse eid="LAM 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 2:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kafiliti kashibomoli shibambaza sha mji gwa Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">kabomoliti libuwi kwa libuwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:8">Shindwalingu na vibambaza vya kunja kumji kavitenda mahami, vyoseri kwa pamuhera vyagamira.<verse eid="LAM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 2:9" />Migomi yakuyi iguwa pasi na vigobeku vya shuma vya kutatira kavimegangameganga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Mfalumi na walonguziya wakuyi wamuwuhamisiwu pakati pa maisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:9">Lagiru kwahera kayi na watambika wakuyi wapatandiri kayi malola kulawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LAM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 2:10" />Wazewi wa Yerusalemu walivaga pasi jii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">na walitilira madikudiku mumituyi na kuvala nguwu za mafafa kulanguziya hinginiku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:10">Wahinga wa Yerusalemu wang'ong'onaziya mituwi pasi kulanguziya wana soni.<verse eid="LAM 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 2:11" />Masu gangu gawera masheri kwa kulira, moyu gwangu guntama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">Hinginika nentu toziya yakwagamiziwa kwa wantu waneni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:11">Ata wana na wanonu wahowa munjira za mji toziya wawera na njara.<verse eid="LAM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 2:12" />Wankuwalilira wamawu wawu, pawalonga shiboga shakoshi na shakulanda sha koshi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">agawu pawaguwa gambira matenduwa munjira za mjini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:12">na wahowera mumawuku ga wamawu wawu.<verse eid="LAM 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 2:13" />Nikugambiri shishi gwee Yerusalemu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Nikulinganiziya na shishi? Nikufananiziya na shintu gaa su wezi kukuzyangazyanga, gwee mhinga Sayuni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:13">Ntambiku yaku ivuwa gambira bahari, gaa hakawezi kukuponiziya?<verse eid="LAM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 2:14" />Malola ga wambuyi waku gaweriti ga mpayu na gafaandiri shintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">wavigubutulandiri vidoda vyaku, su kukulewelera gwenga kugenda muumanda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:14">Visoweru vyawakupananiti viweriti vya mpayu na vya kupotuziya.<verse eid="LAM 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 2:15" />Yawapita njira woseri wankukubolera na kukubeziya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">wakujongera pawatikisiya mtiwu gwee Yerusalemu, pawalonga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:15">Agu ndo mji yaguherepa kuliku miji yoseri kwa uherepa na mji yaguweriti gwana nemeru pasipanu poseri?<verse eid="LAM 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 2:16" />Wankondu waku woseri wankukubolera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">Wankukudokola na kukuwonera maya pawatakula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:16">tumwagamiziya! Nakaka lishaka lirii lyatuliheperiti kwa matamata vinu lisoka na tuliwona.<verse eid="LAM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 2:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu katenda galii gakapangiti, kashitenda shisoweru shakuyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">shakalagaliriti mashaka ga makashu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:17">Kakugusiya pota lusungu, kawatenda wankondu wakulongilongi, kamtenda mnkondu gwaku kaweri na makakala.<verse eid="LAM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 2:18" />Miyoyu ya wantu imlilira Mtuwa Mlungu. Gwee shibambaza sha Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">Masozi gaku gaseleri gambira lushemba paluwala na pashiru!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:18">Pota koyera na masu gaku nagoyera.<verse eid="LAM 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 2:19" />Pashiru poseri gwimuki gwakalili. Gumgambiri Mtuwa Mlungu yagawera mumoyu mwaku.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:19">Gunyasuliri mawoku gaku kuwaluwira wana waku, wana yawaguwa kwa njala munjira.<verse eid="LAM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 2:20" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guliholi. Hashi kwana yoseri yagumtenderiti ntambu yagudutendera twenga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">Hashi ata kina wamawu waliyi wana wawu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:20">Hashi, watambika na wambuyi waku walaguwi Mnumba mwaku?<verse eid="LAM 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 2:21" />Mauti ga wantu yawahiwiti gagonja munjira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">wahinga na wantemba waneni walaguwa kwa nkontu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:21">Guwalagiti pota lusungu lishaka sha maya gaku.<verse eid="LAM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 2:22" />Guwashemera kumsambu, wankondu wangu wazyengetiti kila uwega wantenda ntiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">Mulishaka lya maya gaku gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, kwahera yakashapiliti ama kuponeka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 2:22">Wana yaniwaleriti mweni na kuwafira nentu wankondu wangu wawalaga.<verse eid="LAM 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LAM 3" />
  <para style="s">Kukomangwa, kuleka vidoda na litumbiru</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 3:1" />Neni ndo muntu yankomangitwi toziya ya nkalaliru ya Mlungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 3:2" />Kantola na kunjega kuluwindu yakuwera ndiri na langala.<verse eid="LAM 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 3:3" />Kankomanga kayi na kayi paluwala poseri pota kuleka.<verse eid="LAM 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 3:4" />Kalitenda likuli lyangu na nshimba yaneni izeyeki, mihonju yangu kayimeganga.<verse eid="LAM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 3:5" />Kankangaliti na kuzyengeta kwa utama na ntabiku.<verse eid="LAM 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 3:6" />Kantenda nilikali muluwindu gambira wantu yawahowiti makashu.<verse eid="LAM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 3:7" />Kanzengetera shibambaza su nanshapira, kantawiti kwa minyololu izotopa.<verse eid="LAM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 3:8" />Ata panshema na kumluwa utanga, kumbiti kalema kupikanira maluwa gangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 3:9" />Njira zaneni kazidiwa kwa mabuwi makulu, ata wezandiri kugenda koseri.<verse eid="LAM 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 3:10" />Yomberi kagwadira handa kanyama yawamshema dubu ama simba yakahepelera kunkangala.<verse eid="LAM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 3:11" />Kankwega kulawa munjira, kandeganga na kundeka pota utanga.<verse eid="LAM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 3:12" />Kawunikiti upindi wakuyi na kananguziya msali gwakuyi.<verse eid="LAM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 3:13" />Kansomiti mushimba kwa misali, kulawa muntumbi yakuyi.<verse eid="LAM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 3:14" />Wera lijonga kwa wantu wangu woseri, wera lwimbu lwawu paluwala poseri.<verse eid="LAM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 3:15" />Kamemiziya ntabiku, kantenda weri na utama.<verse eid="LAM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 3:16" />Kasyagira menu gangu mumabuwi, kantenda nkalagati mumalivu.<verse eid="LAM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 3:17" />Kuwera na ponga kuwusiwa kwaneni, ndwaluwa kuwera na mpatiru.<verse eid="LAM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 3:18" />Nilihola panonga, twezuka nakamu, litumbiru lyangu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu liwuka.<verse eid="LAM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 3:19" />Niyihola ntabiku yangu na kuyerayera kwaneni, ndo kukalipa handa shikalikali.<verse eid="LAM 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 3:20" />Niliholera aga mashaka goseri na rohu yangu imema hinginika.<verse eid="LAM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 3:21" />Kumbiti niholiti shisoweru ashi, hangu nanali litumbiru.<verse eid="LAM 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 3:22" />Toziya ufiru wa Mtuwa Mlungu uperandiri, lusungu lwakuyi lwahera upeleru.<verse eid="LAM 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LAM 3:23" />Ndo wasyayi kila mandawira, uwaminika wakuyi ndo mkulu nentu.<verse eid="LAM 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LAM 3:24" />Nilitakulira namweni, Mtuwa Mlungu ndo luhanja lwangu, su hanimtumbiri yomberi.<verse eid="LAM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LAM 3:25" />Mtuwa Mlungu ndo mheri kwa wantu yawamtumbira, na kwa woseri yawamjimira na kwa walii yawamluwa utanga.<verse eid="LAM 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LAM 3:26" />Iherepa muntu kuhepera kwa kunyamalira ulopola yawulawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LAM 3:27" />Na iherepa muntu kulifunda uhepelera, kwanjira shaka sha untemba wakuyi.<verse eid="LAM 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LAM 3:28" />Mbaka kulikala gweka na kunyamala, toziya Mlungu kalagalira shaka shikamala shimwizili.<verse eid="LAM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LAM 3:29" />Kafiruwa kung'ong'onala na kunanagala, pamonga litumbiru badu lyankali.<verse eid="LAM 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LAM 3:30" />Muntu kafiruwa kumgalambulira lisaya yakamkoma na kuwera kala kwigilangwa.<verse eid="LAM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LAM 3:31" />Mtuwa Mlungu hapeni katulemi mashaka goseri.<verse eid="LAM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LAM 3:32" />Tembera katutenda twinginiki, hakaweri na lusungu kayi kwa uvuwa wa ufiru wakuyi.<verse eid="LAM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LAM 3:33" />Yomberi kafirandiri kuwajegera ntabiku pota kuwahinginiziya wantu.<verse eid="LAM 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LAM 3:34" />Mtuwa kavimana watatirwa woseri muisi pawatendelwa madoda,<verse eid="LAM 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LAM 3:35" />kagamana galii yagafiruwa kupananwa muntu, pagapotoziwa kulongolu kwa Mlungu Mkulu,<verse eid="LAM 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LAM 3:36" />kumwima Muntu yagafiruwa kupananwa kuvyotera motu, hashi Mtuwa Mlungu kagawonandiri aga?<verse eid="LAM 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LAM 3:37" />Gaa yakaweza kulagalira shintu shilawiri, handa Mtuwa Mlungu pakalagalirandiri iweri hangu?<verse eid="LAM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LAM 3:38" />Makontola na maheri galawira hera kwa lilagaliru lya Mlungu Mkulu.<verse eid="LAM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LAM 3:39" />Ntambu gaa muntu kalalami, payiwera kakomangwa kwa vidoda vyakuyi?<verse eid="LAM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LAM 3:40" />Tufiruwa kulilolera twaweni na kujera matendu getu, su tumwuyiri Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LAM 3:41" />Patukuluwa Mlungu gwa kumpindi na kulaviya miyoyu yetu patulonga,<verse eid="LAM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LAM 3:42" />“Twenga tukutendera vidoda na kukugalambuka na gwenga gutulekeziyandiri.”<verse eid="LAM 3:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LAM 3:43" />Guwera na maya na kutufata, gutulagiti pota lusungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LAM 3:44" />Gulizyengetera kwa liwundi lizotopa, maluwa gatwenga goseri nagapena amu.<verse eid="LAM 3:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LAM 3:45" />Gututenda kuwera uhakata na udoda muwamu mwa wantu wa isi zimonga.<verse eid="LAM 3:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LAM 3:46" />“Wankondu wetu woseri wankutubolera.”<verse eid="LAM 3:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LAM 3:47" />Tutabika kwa ntiliziwu na lyoga vyavitwizira na tuwera mumaagamiziya na vintu vyetu wavyagamiziya.<verse eid="LAM 3:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LAM 3:48" />Masozi galawa mumasu gangu gambira nshemba za mashi toziya ya kulaguwa kwa wantu waneni.<verse eid="LAM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LAM 3:49" />Masu gangu galawa masozi pota koya,<verse eid="LAM 3:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LAM 3:50" />mpaka Mtuwa Mlungu kulawa kumpindi kaloli pasi na kuwona.<verse eid="LAM 3:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LAM 3:51" />Niliti nentu panigawoniti galii yagawapatiti wadala wa mji gwangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LAM 3:52" />Wankondu wangu yawankalaliriti pota likosa, wawinga gambira mpongu.<verse eid="LAM 3:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LAM 3:53" />Wanasiliti m ulirindi pawera mkomu na pampindi paneni wanasira mabuhi.<verse eid="LAM 3:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LAM 3:54" />Mashi ganjiti kungibikira kumtuwi na neni niliholiti, awu ndo upeleru wangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:54" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LAM 3:55" />Kulawa pasi pa lirindi nikulililiti. Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="LAM 3:55" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LAM 3:56" />Gwenga gumpikanira panikulilira, naguleka kupikanira kuluwa utanga kwa neni.<verse eid="LAM 3:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LAM 3:57" />Panikushemiti gusokiti pakwegera na neni gung'ambira nagutira.<verse eid="LAM 3:57" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LAM 3:58" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guntanga muntabiku yangu, na gugalopola makaliru gangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:58" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LAM 3:59" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guwuwona ukontola yawuntenderitwi guntoziti kwa uheri wa visoweru vyangu.<verse eid="LAM 3:59" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LAM 3:60" />Guwuwona ukontola wa wankondu wangu na mipangu yawu yoseri midoda kwa neni.<verse eid="LAM 3:60" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LAM 3:61" />“Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu gupikanira pawanihigiranga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 3:61">na mipangu yawu yoseri midoda kwa neni.”<verse eid="LAM 3:61" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LAM 3:62" />Lishaka lyoseri wankondu wangu visoweru vyawu na maholu gawu ndo kundaga neni.<verse eid="LAM 3:62" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LAM 3:63" />Guwalori shaka shoseri pawawera walivaga ama wankugenda, wambolera neni hera.<verse eid="LAM 3:63" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LAM 3:64" />“Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guwatozi, ntambu ya vitendu vyawu, teratera na galii ganigatenditi.”<verse eid="LAM 3:64" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LAM 3:65" />Guwapangiri na kuwatabisiya,<verse eid="LAM 3:65" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LAM 3:66" />“toziya guwakalalira guwagendeli na guwalagi kulawa muisi!”<verse eid="LAM 3:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LAM 4" />
  <para style="s">Kumalilika kwa likomangu Yerusalamu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 4:1" />Ntambu gaa zahabu yaying'ereng'etiti ihowiziya mng'eleng'etu wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:1">Mabuwi ga beyi nkulu kulawa Numba ya Mlungu gapalangulwanga munjira yoseri.<verse eid="LAM 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 4:2" />Wana wa Sayuni yawazyumikiti nentu na kupananwa ligoya handa zahabu iherepa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:2">ntambu gaa vinu wawera handa vyombu vya litapaka, lihengu lya mkuluga.<verse eid="LAM 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 4:3" />Ata limihi kawanoniziya wana wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:3">kumbiti wantu waneni wawera wangesera, watenda handa mbuni kushiwala<verse eid="LAM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 4:4" />Miromu ya wanonu iyuma kwa kwimiluwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:4">wana waluwa shiboga kumbiti kwahera yakawapanana.<verse eid="LAM 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 4:5" />Wantu yawaliyiti viboga viherepa vinu wankuhowa munjira kwa njala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:5">Yawalelitwi na kuvalaziwa shifalumi vinu wankugoja kushifungusi.<verse eid="LAM 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 4:6" />Wantu wangu wakomangwa nentu kuliku wantu wa muji gwa Sodoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:6">gweni gulunguziwitwi vumu pota kuwera na gwakuwatanga.<verse eid="LAM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 4:7" />Wakulu wa Yerusalemu waweriti wafufu mbu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:7">Nshimba zawu ziweriti na makakala handa madini ga rubi.<verse eid="LAM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 4:8" />Kumbiti vinu vyeni vyawu vititu kuliku makala, wamanika ndiri munjira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:8">likuli lyawu lilibata na mihonju yawu, mihonju ayi iyuma handa mbawu.<verse eid="LAM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 4:9" />Mbaka yawalagitwi munkondu kuliku yawahowiti kwa njala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:9">watabikiti kwa njala mpaka wahowa, toziya waweritindiri na shiboga sha kulawa mumalambu.<verse eid="LAM 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 4:10" />Wamawu yawaweriti na lusugu nentu wawaterikiti wana wawu weni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:10">wawatenda kuwera shiboga shawu shaka wantu waneni pawagamiziwitwi.<verse eid="LAM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 4:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalanguziyiti uzotopa wa nkalala yakuyi, kaminta maya gakuyi gakalipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:11">kayakaziyiti motu kumjini Sayuni aku kalunguziyiti numba kwanjira kumpindi mpaka kumiyanjiru.<verse eid="LAM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 4:12" />Wafalumi na wenikaya woseri pasipanu waminitindiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:12">kuwera mkankala ama mnkondu mekingili mumigomi ya Yerusalemu.<verse eid="LAM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 4:13" />Kumbiti ali lilawiriti toziya ya vidoda vya wambuyi wakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:13">na makontola ga watambika wakuyi, weni wawalagiti wantu yawahera na vidoda.<verse eid="LAM 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 4:14" />Walonguziya wayerayera munjira handa wanalwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:14">waweriti na mwazi munguwu zawu, ata kuweriti ndiri na muntu yoseri gwa kuwashinkula.<verse eid="LAM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 4:15" />Wantu wawashowera pawalonga, “Muwuki” mgendi zyenu mwenga mdoda na mjimilikandiri! “Muwuki, muwuki, namshinkula shoseri.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">Su waweriti watuga isi na kuyerayera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:15">wantu wa maisi gamonga watakuliti. Awa hapeni washemerwi kulikala kwa twenga.<verse eid="LAM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 4:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu mweni kawapalasiyiti na kawasherandiri kayi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:16">Watambika hapeniwapati kayi ligoya, walonguziya hapeniwapendelewi kayi.<verse eid="LAM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 4:17" />Tutokiti kulikala masu kuhepera utanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:17">tugonjitindiri na kuhepera kwa matamata isi yeni iwezitindiri kutulopola.<verse eid="LAM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 4:18" />Wankondu wetu watuwinga, ata tusinditi kupita munjira zyetu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:18">Mashaka getu gaweriti gatimiya, na upeleru wetu uweriti usoka.<verse eid="LAM 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 4:19" />Yawatufatiti waweriti kalongola kuliku nkashanga muliyera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:19">watutugiziyiti kumigongu na kutugwadira kushiwala aku.<verse eid="LAM 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 4:20" />Wambata mfalumi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">mfalumi ulii yakalumikitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, ulii mweni tutakuliti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:20">Pa ulolera wakuyi hatulikali muwamu mwa maisi.<verse eid="LAM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 4:21" />Wantu wa Edomu, muweza kufyapilira vinu, viraa muweza kusekelera mwenga wantu wa Uzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:21">kumbiti makomangu hagawawiziri na mwenga hamlandi na kulowera, mpaka hamvuli nguwu zenu!<verse eid="LAM 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 4:22" />Gwee Sayuni nkomangu ya ukontola waku ipera, Mtuwa Mlungu hapenikawaleki muwuhamisiwu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 4:22">Kumbiti mwenga wantu wa Edomu hakawakomangi kwa ukontola wenu na hakavituli paweru vidoda vyenu.<verse eid="LAM 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LAM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kuluwa lusungu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LAM 5:1" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guliholi mirandu yayitupatiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:1">Na gwenga guwoni soni ya twenga.<verse eid="LAM 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LAM 5:2" />Isi yetu wapananwa wahenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:2">na numba zyetu wapananwa wantu wamonga.<verse eid="LAM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LAM 5:3" />Tuwera washiwa yawahera tati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:3">na wamawu wetu wawera handa wakenja.<verse eid="LAM 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LAM 5:4" />Mpaka tuhemeri mashi gatulanda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:4">na mbawu tuzihemera.<verse eid="LAM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LAM 5:5" />Watukankanika kutenda lihengu gambira punda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:5">tutoka kumbiti watulewelera kwoyela.<verse eid="LAM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LAM 5:6" />Tutenda lihengu kwa Misri na Ashuru,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:6">su tupati shiboga shivuwa.<verse eid="LAM 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LAM 5:7" />Wazewi wetu watenditi vidoda na vinu kwahera kayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:7">na twenga twankutabika toziya ya makosa gawu.<verse eid="LAM 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LAM 5:8" />Wamanda ndo yawatukolamlima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:8">na kwahera gwa kutulopola mumawoku gawu.<verse eid="LAM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LAM 5:9" />Shiboga shetu tushipata kwa kugatula makaliru getu mukutenduwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:9">toziya yawalaga wankuzyengetazyengeta kumalambu.<verse eid="LAM 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LAM 5:10" />Makuli getu gana motu handa shifinja sha kubanikira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:10">toziya ya njala yayitabisiya.<verse eid="LAM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LAM 5:11" />Wankondu wetu wawatendera vidoda wahinga wetu kumjini Sayuni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:11">na wahinga wetu muvijiji vya Yuda.<verse eid="LAM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LAM 5:12" />Walonguziya watwenga watolwa na kukongerwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:12">wankontu wetu wawapananwandiri ligoya wazewi wetu.<verse eid="LAM 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LAM 5:13" />Wana wapalu wakakanikwa kusyaga viboga kwa mabuwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:13">wantemba wankuwegukaweguka kwa visanka vya mbawu.<verse eid="LAM 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LAM 5:14" />Wazewi waleka kulaviya matakuziya gawu muligomi lya mji na wantemba waleka kwimba na kugomba ngoma.<verse eid="LAM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LAM 5:15" />Nemeru iwuka mumiyoyu yatwenga, kuvina kwa twenga kugalambuka madaya.<verse eid="LAM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LAM 5:16" />Mfalumi yatumtumbiriti kawuka. Hatushiwoni twenga, toziya tutenda vidoda!<verse eid="LAM 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LAM 5:17" />Toziya ya aga tulwala mumoyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:17">toziya ayi masu getu gawonaweri ndiri.<verse eid="LAM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LAM 5:18" />Toziya lugongu Siyoni lulekwa pota shintu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:18">na vibweta wazyengetazyengeta pampindi pakuyi.<verse eid="LAM 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LAM 5:19" />Kumbiti gwenga Mtuwa Mlungu gukolamlima mashaka goseri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:19">Shiti shaku sha ukulu shilikala mashaka goseri.<verse eid="LAM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LAM 5:20" />Ntambu gaa gutuwaluwa mashaka goseri?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:20">Ntambu gaa gutuleka shaka shitali?<verse eid="LAM 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LAM 5:21" />Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gutuwuziyi zyuma yetu, su tukuwuyili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LAM 5:21">gugatendi syayi mashaka getu handa mashaka ga makashu.<verse eid="LAM 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LAM 5:22" />Hashi gutulema nakamu? Ama gutukalalira nentu?<verse eid="LAM 5:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LAM 5" />
</usx>